  3. **Symmetric Encryption Keys:** Hardcoded 128-bit/256-bit AES keys in `ip-token.php` allow arbitrary synthesis of valid client integrity tokens.
  4. **Third-Party API Keys & Webhooks:** Google reCAPTCHA v3 private secret keys, ProxyCheck API keys, and Discord modlog webhook URLs are embedded directly in source code.
  5. **Default Cookie & CSRF Salts:** `inc/config.php` defaults to fixed salts (`$config['cookies']['salt']`), rendering tokens predictable across all default installations.

