### <a id="vuln-05"></a>[VULN-05] Reflected Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) via `javascript:` Pseudo-Protocol in Media Player (`player.php`)

> [!NOTE]
> **Audit Occurrence Disclaimer:** Found in **8 of 9** available audit reports (`8e693d74`, `3643eaa6`, `6bb7274b`, `56468d00`, `88c733dd`, `c6fa5ed1`, `a3b97157`, `5e432690`).

