| :--- | :--- |
| **Vulnerability Identifier** | `VULN-05` |
| **Severity Level** | **🟡 Medium** |
| **Vulnerability Classification** | CWE-79 (Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation), CVSS 6.1 (Medium) |
| **Primary Target Locations** | `Repository-wide` |

#### Technical Description & Exploit Mechanics

In `player.php`, user-supplied input from `$_GET['v']` is extracted and echoed into the HTML document:
  ```php
  $v = @(string)$_GET['v'];
  ...
