#### Technical Description & Exploit Mechanics

`vote.php` accepts `GET` requests (`?board=soy&id=123`) to cast deletion votes on posts:
  ```php
  if (isset($_GET['board']) && isset($_GET['id'])) {
      if ($post['mediator_votes'] + 1 >= 5) {
          modLog('Deleting post #' . $_GET['id'] . ' as it reached the voting threshold');
