  State-altering voting and post deletion occur via HTTP `GET` with no CSRF tokens. Embedding `<img src="https://example.com/vote.php?board=soy&id=123">` on external websites or within forum posts triggers automated background voting from visitors, permanently deleting threads once 5 votes are logged.

