#### Technical Description & Exploit Mechanics

The item purchase balance validation and wallet balance updates are split across non-atomic operations:
  ```php
  // shop.php
  if (get_shop_balance($_POST['password']) - $item['price'] < 0) {
      error('You cannot afford this item.');
  }
  add_shop_balance($_POST['password'], $item['price'] * -1);

